  "beats": [
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:01Z",
      "text": "According to the news item, Anthropic employee and mathematician Levent Alpöge has released a claimed proof of the Riemann hypothesis, created with assistance from Claude.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-20:10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:08Z",
      "text": "On November 20, 2026, two proofs were posted online.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386894649:189"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:15Z",
      "text": "The Riemann hypothesis is the statement that the Riemann zeta function has its zeros only at the negative even integers and at complex numbers whose real part is \\textstyle\\frac{1}{2}.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:rev:1386894649:0"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:25Z",
      "text": "Readers also turned to the pages for Levent Alpöge, with 124,632 readers, and for Anthropic, with 89,567.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Levent_Alpöge:2026-11-20",
        "views:en:Anthropic:2026-11-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:34Z",
      "text": "On 20 November 2026, 295,157 people read the English article, about 187 times the usual daily count.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Riemann_hypothesis:2026-11-20",
        "views:en:Riemann_hypothesis:prior"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:41Z",
      "text": "The article was read in 11 languages, and after English the most readers were in French, with 35,396.",
      "cites": [
        "views:en:Riemann_hypothesis:2026-11-20",
        "views:fr:Hypothèse_de_Riemann:2026-11-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:48Z",
      "text": "On the globe, each language glows where it is mainly spoken, brighter for more readers, though a language is not the same as a country.",
      "cites": [
        "views:fr:Hypothèse_de_Riemann:2026-11-20",
        "views:de:Riemannsche_Vermutung:2026-11-20",
        "views:pl:Hipoteza_Riemanna:2026-11-20",
        "views:ja:リーマン予想:2026-11-20",
        "views:zh:黎曼猜想:2026-11-20",
        "views:ru:Гипотеза_Римана:2026-11-20"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:00:58Z",
      "text": "The story is reported by the BBC.",
      "cites": [
        "wiki:2026-11-20:10"
      ]
    },
    {
      "t": "2026-11-20T00:01:06Z",
